'''Kung-Fu X Awakens!''' (開眼のカンフーにゃんこG襲来！''Kaigan no Kanfū Nyanko G Shūrai!'', '''Awakened Kung-Fu Cat G Attacks!''') introduces the [[True Form]] of [[Kung Fu Cat X (Rare Cat)|Kung Fu Cat X]] - Iron Claw X. This event was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].

